<description>&lt;p&gt;Grenade blasts wounded security volunteers in Narathiwar and Yala and a pipe bomb injured army officers in the same insurgency zone. Thailand rejected Cambodia's claims over two temples and artefacts and protested Cambodia's road construction in Oddar Meanchey, while Cambodia continued to protest the construction and temple disputes. Thailand is introducing digital border passes at the Mae Sai crossing and has joined Singapore and Malaysia in the BLOOM cross-border digital money settlement initiative. The first phase of a border fence in Chanthaburi has been completed. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Cambodianess&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxNT2RIdVQ1NnlDUERJN0RPS0dyRlNkcVhSTTVlc0hoekxFN3FyVTIxb3hMbWkzNTFteERkUHpQZ3l2anpZMlZNcng4aHktQ1lhdUY5ZzBnejVESE1ZMUZoR3N4NlpWOVNpLTUyQ3kzdlRZM2Z2cXZYNjF3YjBpb2Y2QXcyYjJIX3lGdWJVcWRmdmlBVy1Mc3VCM25JTTZvdXVCVWpBN3UwYXZZVHB6RXlwQ1V0dFZpQTh6djBVR0VlNnBKaVZCR1RoQzhDRDljdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Blockhead&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Báo Cần Thơ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE1UVFp2SnhQTTN4MDdFQ2loWEhxRXY3NjBPbTJMNlhuOGxXc2N2MGxnalVJTS0tN3lkd0otVkVua0t0bEtmQ19jS0l1TndvYU5lUVp2U19uLWVkSGpsYmtKN2tB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQVGF0Rm1JZjM5dFdHWUV5bTN5QXJDSXBhd0U1a0pDVHdrcTUtR0NZTDlCcElfMGlsT2ZqbmVQTGRRV1JRSkNQZmdCbzNiYlY5OVBmUnZTejc0SVBzdmEyMTU5VkUyaWtEVzlLc1pUTnhOcGc3SEgzTEpqVEhLRUV2ODNpUXE3ZFFqRlZzazRRRFAxWlZpNE5FNktCcGZpUEhQU2RYUm84Wl9FOGJONEtYdVFmRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thailand Business News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPZ2ZkaGhDWjg1YWh4S3No